<mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;MARS-OPS: Object Diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Object-state snapshot after &lt;i&gt;Main.setup()&lt;/i&gt;, followed by handling &lt;i&gt;leak1&lt;/i&gt; (as in Scenario 4) and &lt;i&gt;fire2&lt;/i&gt;. Both emergencies are resolved. &lt;i&gt;fire2&lt;/i&gt; is illustrative: &lt;i&gt;Main.main()&lt;/i&gt; does not create it, so its description and oxygenConsumption are example values." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="300" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
